  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SAFE RETURN - Reintegration and Recovery Assistance in Areas of Return in Iraq (AWDA AMINA)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The aim of this project is to contribute to well-managed migration in Iraq and improve the resilience of migrants, forcibly displaced persons and host communities. It includes a number of measures that will strengthen institutional capacities relating to the governance and management of migration, as well as a series of activities that enable the reintegration of returnees and strengthen crisis-affected communities, including livelihood support, activities to strengthen social cohesion, the provision of social services, increased information on reintegration assistance and support to localization through the capacity building of civil society organizations.</narrative>
  </description>
